    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 24 occurrences, first GEN.45.7; Childs 2000, p. 8: bàŋǎŋndó</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Moyen de baŋa « sauver ».</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="baŋannde_114">
