    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>scoop up, draw (water); collect, pile together</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 8 occurrences, first GEN.18.4; Childs 2000, p. 175: kòndòó</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>kondul (bénéfactif) « apporter à » (Ex 5,10).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="kongillo_1689">
