  <entry id="kpangbaɲaala_1813">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>kpangbaɲaala</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>kpangbaɲaalaa</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="kpangbaɲaala_1813_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>puce</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>flea</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="1.6.1 Types of animals"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>bed bugs</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 1 occurrences, first 1SA.26.20; Childs 2000, p. 205: kpàŋgbáɲààláá</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Yéè ya kpangbaɲaalaa ho n co tovɔɔ ho ni nɛ ? « est-ce une puce que tu poursuis ? » (1SA.24.15) ; kpangbaɲaala fondoo (1SA.26.20).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="kpankpaa ɲala_1814">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>kpankpaa ɲala</text></form></lexical-unit>
