      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="1.6.1 Types of animals"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Keita 1979, p. 136: Kölölöndöö; Lexique kissi–français, p. 27: kɔlɔlɔndɔɔ</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="kɔ̀lɔ̀tɔ̀ɔ́_2198">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>kɔ̀lɔ̀tɔ̀ɔ́</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="o"/>
    <trait name="status" value="southern"/>
    <field type="plural"><form lang="kqs"><text>kɔ̀lɔ̀tɔ̀láŋ</text></form></field>
    <sense id="kɔ̀lɔ̀tɔ̀ɔ́_2198_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>philtre pour faire accepter ses suggestions</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>potion to make people go along with one's suggestions</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.9.4 Miracle, supernatural power"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Childs 2000, p. 183: kɔ̀lɔ̀tɔ̀ɔ́ kɔ̀lɔ̀tɔ̀láŋ</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="kɔ́lɔ́vúloo_2199">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>kɔ́lɔ́vúloo</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="o"/>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <field type="plural"><form lang="kqs"><text>kɔ́lɔ́vúlua</text></form></field>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>kɔ́lɔ́vúlu</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="kɔ́lɔ́vúloo_2199_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>ours</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>bear</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="1.6.1 Types of animals"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 6 occurrences, first 1SA.17.34</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>kɔ́lɔ́vúlu-bɛndoo « la Grande Ourse » (Jb 9,9).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="kɔlɔŋndo_2200">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>kɔlɔŋndo</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="o"/>
    <trait name="status" value="respelled"/>
    <sense id="kɔlɔŋndo_2200_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>puits</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>well</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="6.5.4 Infrastructure"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="1.3.1 Bodies of water"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Keita 1979, p. 142: Kölönndo; Lexique kissi–français, p. 27: kɔlɔnndo; Childs 2000, p. 183: kɔ́lɔ́ŋndó</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>ŋ d'après Childs (emprunt au maninka). La Bible dit soon kólaa pour « puits, source » (Gn 16,7).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="kɔlɔɔ_2201">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>kɔlɔɔ</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="o"/>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>kɔlɔ</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="kɔlɔɔ_2201_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>affaire, cause, raison ; (le kɔlɔ yɛɛ) pourquoi ; explication, but</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>matter, cause, reason; (le kɔlɔ yɛɛ) why; explanation, purpose</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="9.6 Connected with, related"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="9.1.3 Thing"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>meaning, significance, rationale</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 34 occurrences, first GEN.11.9; Lexique kissi–français, p. 27: kɔrɔɔ; Childs 2000, p. 183: kɔ́lɔ́ɔ</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Lexique kissi–français, p. 27 : écrit kɔrɔɔ.</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="kɔlɔɔ_2202">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>kɔlɔɔ</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="respelled"/>
    <sense id="kɔlɔɔ_2202_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>pépinière</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>seedbed, nursery</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="6.2.3 Plant a field"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Lexique kissi–français, p. 27: kɔlɔɔ</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Homographe de kɔlɔɔ « affaire, cause » (Bible).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="kɔlɲuloo_2203">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>kɔlɲuloo</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="o"/>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <field type="plural"><form lang="kqs"><text>kɔlɲululan</text></form></field>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>kɔlɲulu</text></form></variant>
