    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Childs 2000, p. 322: sǎŋsèèŋgíàŋndó</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="saŋɔɔ_3459">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>saŋɔɔ</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>saŋ</text></form></variant>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>saŋnin</text></form></variant>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>seŋ</text></form></variant>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>seŋnin</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="saŋɔɔ_3459_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>semer ; disperser ; semer à la volée</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>sow; scatter; broadcast (seed)</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="6.2.3 Plant a field"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>sow (grain)</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 27 occurrences, first GEN.47.19; Keita 1979, p. 115: Sanhöö; Lexique kissi–français, p. 46: saŋɔɔ/ saŋ, seŋ; Childs 2000, p. 322: sàŋɔ̀ɔ́</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>seŋ, seŋnin : radical négatif (MAT 6,26 ; LEV 25,20). saŋ « disperser » (EXO 9,8).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
