    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Childs 2000, p. 327: sɛ́lɛ̀lɛ́</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛmbaa_3825">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛmbaa</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛmba</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="sɛmbaa_3825_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>se détacher (d'un bloc)</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>break off, be cut out (from a mass)</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="7.8 Divide into pieces"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>break off or take away a part; whittle</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 1 occurrences, first DAN.2.45; Childs 2000, p. 327: sɛ̀mbàá</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>powvo sɛmba a ba ndɔ o pembei « une pierre se détacha de la montagne » (DAN.2.34, DAN.2.45).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛmbɔɔ_3826">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛmbɔɔ</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="o"/>
    <trait name="status" value="respelled"/>
    <sense id="sɛmbɔɔ_3826_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>puissance</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>power</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="2.4.1 Strong"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Lexique kissi–français, p. 48: sɛnbɔɔ</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛmtɔɔ_3827">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛmtɔɔ</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="o"/>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <sense id="sɛmtɔɔ_3827_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>véranda, perron, marches</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>veranda, porch, steps</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="6.5.2 Parts of a building"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 4 occurrences, first 1KI.7.19; Keita 1979, p. 142: Sèmtöö; Lexique kissi–français, p. 48: sɛmtɔɔ</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Ac 21,35 : les marches de la forteresse ; 1 R 7,19 : tongo-sɛmtɔɔ « vestibule ».</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛndio_3828">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛndio</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛndi</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="sɛndio_3828_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>redresser ; allumer, attiser (le feu)</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>straighten; kindle, fan (a fire)</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="8.3.1 Shape"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="5.5 Fire"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 2 occurrences, first PSA.18.33; Lexique kissi–français, p. 48: sɛndio/ sɛndi</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Lexique : « redresser ; allumer (une allumette) ». Bible : nilan sɛndio « redresser les chemins » (PSA.18.33), sɛndi yinnden « attiser le feu » (EZK.22.20).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛndullo_3829">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛndullo</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="respelled"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛndul</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="sɛndullo_3829_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>s'allonger pour qqn</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>stretch out for someone</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="7.1.3 Lie down"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Lexique kissi–français, p. 48: sɛndullo/ sɛndul</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Le Lexique met un point d'interrogation au radical.</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛnduo_3830">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛnduo</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="respelled"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛndu</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="sɛnduo_3830_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>allonger plusieurs fois</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>lengthen repeatedly</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="8.2.2 Long"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Lexique kissi–français, p. 48: sɛnduo/ sɛndu</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛnndan_3831">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛnndan</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <sense id="sɛnndan_3831_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>savon, potasse</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>soap, lye</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="5.6.2 Bathe"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="5.6.1 Clean, dirty"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>soap</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 2 occurrences, first JOB.9.30; Lexique kissi–français, p. 48: sɛnndan; Childs 2000, p. 328: sɛ̌ŋndáŋ</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Hali pulun bɛɛ a sodaa mà vownun sɛnndan coo taw « même si tu te laves avec du nitre et beaucoup de savon » (JER.2.22) ; pulun … a sɛnndan (JOB.9.30). Lexique kissi–français, p. 48 : aussi sɛndan.</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛnɛiyo_3832">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛnɛiyo</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛnɛi</text></form></variant>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛnɛiyan</text></form></variant>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛnɛilan</text></form></variant>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛnɛiye</text></form></variant>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛnɛiyon</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="sɛnɛiyo_3832_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Adjective"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>nouveau, neuf</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>new</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="8.3 Quality"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="8.4.5 Relative time"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>new, fresh</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 77 occurrences, first EXO.6; Lexique kissi–français, p. 46: sanɛiyo; Childs 2000, p. 328: sènèí-</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Lexique kissi–français, p. 46 : sanɛiyo « les nouveaux ».</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛsiei_3833">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛsiei</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="i"/>
    <trait name="status" value="respelled"/>
    <sense id="sɛsiei_3833_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>jardin</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>garden</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="6.2.9 Farmland"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>garden near town, small private farm</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Keita 1979, p. 142: Sèsiei; Lexique kissi–français, p. 49: sɛsiei; Childs 2000, p. 328: sɛ̀sɛ́í</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛsɛi_3834">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛsɛi</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="i"/>
    <trait name="status" value="respelled"/>
    <sense id="sɛsɛi_3834_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>aube</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>dawn</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="8.4.1 Period of time"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Lexique kissi–français, p. 48: sɛsɛi</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Mot ancien selon le Lexique.</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="sɛ̀sɛ́ŋgòlló_3835">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>sɛ̀sɛ́ŋgòlló</text></form></lexical-unit>
