    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 18 occurrences, first EXO.25.23; Lexique kissi–français, p. 53: tabalio; Childs 2000, p. 358: tìbìíyó</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="tàbílìó_3890">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>tàbílìó</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="o"/>
    <trait name="status" value="southern"/>
    <field type="plural"><form lang="kqs"><text>tàbíláŋ</text></form></field>
    <sense id="tàbílìó_3890_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>long tambour (pour appeler à la prière musulmane)</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>long drum (used to call Muslims to prayer)</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.2.3 Music"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Childs 2000, p. 347: tàbílìó</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="taci_3891">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>taci</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="respelled"/>
    <sense id="taci_3891_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Adverb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>en avant, en avance, devant</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>forward, ahead, in front</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="8.5.2 Direction"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="8.6.1 Front"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Lexique kissi–français, p. 53: taci</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="tafiei_3892">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>tafiei</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="i"/>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <field type="plural"><form lang="kqs"><text>tafion</text></form></field>
    <sense id="tafiei_3892_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>dartre, éruption (de la peau), croûte</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>rash, scab, eruption (of the skin)</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="2.5.2 Disease"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="2.1.4 Skin"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>skin disease with dry flaky skin</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 4 occurrences, first LEV.13.2; Childs 2000, p. 347: tàfìèí</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Te kpukpuei, tafiei, te kon te sɔŋndo pum fula pɛ vanndo lekɔɔ « s'il paraît sur la peau d'un homme une tumeur, une dartre ou une tache » (LEV.13.2) ; le tafion (LEV.14.55).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="táfùlàà_3893">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>táfùlàà</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="southern"/>
